<title>USA: Diana declines comment on stock activity.</title>
<headline>Diana declines comment on stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diana Corp on Tuesday declined commment on the activity in its stock.</p>
<p>Diana said the New York Stock Exchange had asked it to make a statement because the stock was one of yesterday's top gainers on the NYSE. Diana said company policy was not to comment.</p>
<p>The stock was down one at 31.</p>
</text>
